Scenario "right_margin_and_unicode"
Command "andiron-fixture"
Terminal rows 4 cols 12
Cursor row 1 col 1

Step "show prompt"
WaitFrontendLineStartsWith "maqi>" timeout 5000ms
Settle 0ms
Expect:
  r00 |maqi>·······|
  r01 |············|
  r02 |············|
  r03 |············|

Step "fill the final column"
Input "123456"
Settle 0ms
Expect:
